{"id":"vod_md_3236","vodId":"3236","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"K","name_cn":"K","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230825-1/8f29ceb0fbd2e78d1a608b6955209a56.jpg"},"summary":"《K》是以革新作家集团「GoRA」的7名匿名作家的小说为原著。故事以与现实有着微妙历史差异的现代日本为舞台，描写了七位“王”各自的执着，以及被卷入其中的少年的命运与异能者之间战斗。“赤之王”周防尊所率领的吠舞罗与“青之王”宗像礼司所率领的Scepter4因追杀某起事件的嫌疑人：—名为小白的伊佐那社而互相对立。但小白对这件事却没有什么记忆，毫不知情的他逃避着来自两个集团追杀。而出现在这样的小白面前的是身着黑服的纤细长发少年——夜刀神狗朗。也正因为与他的邂逅，小白的命运从此走上了不同的轨道......","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-25 08:06:13","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/xXfYJ6WV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/cLvU0iAa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/yWK6VbDo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/xy4jDRek/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/N3yyOjeX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/A2laFopm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/QEIJlcAd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/BiKyiiBE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/hYPZ6rro/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/rPfESjx2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/XF7MRlCJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/Qc0Ge8lj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/cPSrtcyV/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:10.392Z"}